Generated Anchor support catalogs include facts derived from Apache-2.0 Anchor
source files in the `otter-sec/anchor` workspace:

- `Cargo.toml`
- `lang/syn/src/parser/accounts/constraints.rs`
- `lang/syn/src/parser/accounts/mod.rs`
- `lang/error/src/lib.rs`
- `lang/src/lib.rs`
- `spl/src/associated_token.rs`
- `spl/src/token.rs`
- `spl/src/token_2022.rs`
- `spl/src/token_interface.rs`
- `examples/**/programs/**/src/**/*.rs`
- `tests/**/programs/**/src/**/*.rs`

The generated catalogs are checked in under `lsp/src/generated/` so normal
builds do not scrape those upstream files.
